Package: lgspline
Type: Package
Title: Lagrangian Multiplier Smoothing Splines for Smooth Function Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Matthew", "Davis", email = "matthewlouisdavis@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9714-1018"))
Description: Implements Lagrangian multiplier smoothing splines for flexible
    nonparametric regression and function estimation. Provides tools for fitting,
    prediction, and inference using a constrained optimization approach to 
    enforce smoothness.
    Supports generalized linear models, Weibull AFT models, quadratic programming 
    problems, and customizable arbitrary correlation structures. Options for
    fitting in parallel are provided. 
